-- Stormshield, Warspear, Shrine of Seven Stars, Boralus, Dazar'alor, both Dalarans and Shattrath (Four, 2026-11-15), same
-- checks as the eight capitals (2026_11_14_30..32). TDB 7.3.5 covers Stormshield, Shattrath and Northrend Dalaran; Warspear,
-- Boralus, Dazar'alor and Broken Isles Dalaran have no reference, so only clear doubles were removed there.
-- Shrine of Seven Stars: nothing to fix. Foreign names are fixed in 2026_11_16_30.
--
-- Doubles: same creature within half a yard of its twin (same phase), or a named NPC (at most 3 spawns in the world) spawned
-- again within 6 yards; same gameobject within half a yard. The lowest guid is kept. None of the removed spawns is used by
-- SmartAI, pools, formations, linked respawns, spawn groups or game events.

-- STORMSHIELD (Stormshield Officers and the cart horses walk TDB 7.3.5 routes)
